  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    Korean Recipes, Explained is a recipe blog for English-speaking home cooks who want
    to make real Korean food at home — from well-known favorites to quick, simple dishes
    inspired by Korean home cooks. Recipes start as AI-assisted drafts and are reviewed
    and tested for clarity by a human before publishing, with substitutions and tips
    added for cooks who don't have easy access to a Korean grocery store.
  </p>
